Third-party files in this folder
================================

pieces/cburnett/*.svg
    The "cburnett" chess pieces by Colin M.L. Burnett (GPLv2 or later),
    as embedded in @lichess-org/chessground 10.2.0
    (assets/chessground.cburnett.css, GPL-3.0-or-later), the same set the
    app's board shows. Extracted unchanged from the CSS's base64 data URIs.

IBMPlexSansCondensed-SemiBold-latin.ttf
    IBM Plex Sans Condensed SemiBold, Latin subset, Copyright 2019 IBM Corp.,
    under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL.txt). Taken from
    @fontsource/ibm-plex-sans-condensed 5.3.0
    (files/ibm-plex-sans-condensed-latin-600-normal.woff), the font the
    app's board coordinates use; the WOFF container was unpacked to a plain
    TrueType file (tables unchanged). Only the outlines of a-h and 1-8 are
    used, for the coordinate labels of board images.
